  'tools.api.fMessages': ['system / user / assistant / tool; текст или части text и image_url (data:image/…;base64). Ассистент — с `tool_calls`, результат инструмента — `role: "tool"` с `tool_call_id`', 'system / user / assistant / tool; text or text and image_url parts (data:image/…;base64). An assistant message carries `tool_calls`, a tool result is `role: "tool"` with `tool_call_id`', 'system / user / assistant / tool; tekst ili delovi text i image_url (data:image/…;base64). Asistent — sa `tool_calls`, rezultat alata — `role: "tool"` sa `tool_call_id`'],
